    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27366" root="طول" body-key="T">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَائِلَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَوْلٌ</span>, second sentence. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also
<i>Enmity:</i> and <i>blood-revenge:</i> (S, O, K, TA:) pl.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَوَائِلُ</span>. (TA.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ يَطْلُبُ بَنِى فُلَانٍ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِطَائِلَةٍ</span> i. e. <i>Such a one seeks to obtain of the sons
of such a one blood-revenge.</i> (TA.) [See also an
ex. in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عقل</span>, conj. 8.]

